@startuml
title MS4 · Évaluation — Modèle de classes (S4)

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #F7F9FC
skinparam ClassBorderColor #2E5A88
skinparam ArrowColor #2E5A88
skinparam FontName Helvetica
skinparam FontSize 12
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8E1
skinparam NoteBorderColor #D9A400

class Expert <<aggregate>> {
  +id: UUID
  +keycloakId: String
  +displayName: String
  +domains: List~String~
  --
  +create(ExpertCreate data): Expert {static}
  +isExpertIn(String domain): boolean
  +evaluate(UUID submissionId, EvaluationCreate data): Evaluation
}

class Jury <<entity>> {
  +challengeId: UUID
  +expertIds: List~UUID~
  --
  +constitute(UUID challengeId, List~UUID~ expertIds): Jury {static}
  +addExpert(UUID expertId): void
  +isMember(UUID expertId): boolean
  +quorumReached(): boolean
}

class RubricCriterion <<value object>> {
  +label: String
  +weight: double
  +maxScore: double
  --
  +normalize(double score): double
  +validate(): boolean
}

class Rubric <<aggregate>> {
  +id: UUID
  +challengeId: UUID
  +name: String
  +criteria: List~RubricCriterion~
  --
  +create(RubricCreate data): Rubric {static}
  +totalWeight(): double
  +weightedScore(List~Score~ scores): double
  +criterion(String label): RubricCriterion
}

class Score <<value object>> {
  +criterionLabel: String
  +score: double
  --
  +isValidAgainst(RubricCriterion c): boolean
}

class Evaluation <<entity>> {
  +id: UUID
  +submissionId: UUID
  +expertId: UUID
  +rubricId: UUID
  +scores: List~Score~
  +comment: String
  +weightedScore: double
  +evaluatedAt: LocalDateTime
  --
  +create(EvaluationCreate data): Evaluation {static}
  +computeWeightedScore(Rubric r): double
  +isComplete(Rubric r): boolean
}

class LeaderboardEntry <<read model>> {
  +rank: int
  +submissionId: UUID
  +applicantId: UUID
  +averageScore: double
  +evaluationsCount: int
}

class Winner <<entity>> {
  +rank: int
  +submissionId: UUID
  +applicantId: UUID
  +score: double
  +prizeAmount: double
}

Jury "1" --> "1..*" Expert : expertIds
Rubric "1" *-- "1..*" RubricCriterion : définit
Evaluation "1" *-- "1..*" Score : contient
Evaluation "1" --> "1" Rubric : rubricId
Expert "1" --> "0..*" Evaluation : juge
Jury "1" --> "0..*" Evaluation : supervise
Evaluation "0..*" ..> "0..*" LeaderboardEntry : agrège (moyenne pondérée)
LeaderboardEntry "1..3" ..> "1..3" Winner : déclare
Winner ..> Expert : validation jury

note right of Evaluation
  Seules les soumissions verdict = PASS
  peuvent être notées (409 sinon).
  weightedScore = Σ(score/max × poids) / Σ(poids).
  challengeId (MS1) et submissionId (MS3) :
  références par UUID, aucune FK inter-services.
  Base MySQL dédiée à MS4.
end note

note bottom of Winner
  declare-winners() : top 3, émet winners.declared.
  Refus (409) si notation incomplète
  ou défi déjà clôturé.
  prizeAmount repris des primes MS1.
end note

legend bottom left
  <<read model>> : projection calculée, non persistée comme agrégat.
end legend
@enduml
